---
id: "people"
---

Describe what People is for, and when to reach for something else.

## Visual Contract

<Page>
  <Component name="People" status="draft"
    layoutMode="VERTICAL" primaryAxisSizingMode="AUTO" counterAxisSizingMode="AUTO"
    primaryAxisAlignItems="CENTER" counterAxisAlignItems="CENTER"
    paddingLeft={12} paddingRight={12} paddingTop={8} paddingBottom={8} cornerRadius={6}
    fills={[{ type: 'SOLID', color: { r: 0.933, g: 0.941, b: 0.957, a: 1 } }]}>
    <Text name="label" characters="{item.name}" fontSize={14} repeat="{people}" />
  </Component>
</Page>

## Contract

<Props>
  <Prop name="label" type="string" sample="People">The words it shows.</Prop>
  <Prop name="people" type="Person[]">The Person items to repeat.</Prop>
</Props>

## Models

<Model name="Person">
  Describe what one Person carries.
  <Field name="name" type="string" sample={['Ada', 'Grace', 'Linus']}>Describe the field.</Field>
</Model>
